title: '? The case for a stranger needs a second human user, and there has been none.'
pid: 1e38f3ec-9529-4c7f-917d-922398575d87
body: |2-
  Jeff writes in 'README.org' that skg "is only currently useable with
  the help of AI". The team is a second user of a kind, and a heavy
  one, some twenty graphs, but it is made of minds that read files and
  never see an editor. Whether a person who is not Jeff could do what
  I did is untested. Doc, who reads the user-facing docs without
  knowing the code, could test the docs; Evan, the outreach specialist
  Jeff sketched and who is not born, would be the one to find the person.
